You might want to look at Computational aspects of N‐mixture models <https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/biom.12246> by Emily B. Dennis, Byron J.T. Morgan, and Martin S. Ridout.
 From that article "...
we propose a simple automatic way to choose K."

Jim

